      "timestamp_raw": "Sept 23, 2022 15:08:22 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "That trait is quite prominent on hurricane creek white, although given how flexible leucophylla can be color-wise, I'd say that's not a stable trait.  It usually shows up right when the traps open, but as they age, that color often times goes away!",
      "body_text": "That trait is quite prominent on hurricane creek white, although given how flexible leucophylla can be color-wise, I'd say that's not a stable trait.  It usually shows up right when the traps open, but as they age, that color often times goes away!",
